#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Efficiently calculate and interpret expectation values of the quantum operators required for many algorithms with Estimator. Explore uses in molecular modeling, machine learning, and complex optimization problems.\n"
msgstr "Kira dan tafsirkan nilai jangkaan pengendali kuantum yang diperlukan oleh banyak algoritma dengan cekap menggunakan Estimator. Terokai penggunaannya dalam pemodelan molekular, pembelajaran mesin, dan masalah pengoptimuman yang kompleks.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Run a single experiment {#run-a-single-experiment}"
msgstr "Jalankan satu eksperimen {#run-a-single-experiment}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Use Estimator to determine the expectation value of a single circuit-observable pair.\n"
msgstr "Gunakan Estimator untuk menentukan nilai jangkaan bagi pasangan Circuit-observable tunggal.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Run multiple experiments in a single job {#run-multiple-experiments-in-a-single-job}"
msgstr "Jalankan berbilang eksperimen dalam satu kerja {#run-multiple-experiments-in-a-single-job}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Use Estimator to determine the expectation values of multiple circuit-observable pairs.\n"
msgstr "Gunakan Estimator untuk menentukan nilai jangkaan bagi berbilang pasangan Circuit-observable.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Run parameterized circuits {#run-parameterized-circuits}"
msgstr "Jalankan Circuit berparameter {#run-parameterized-circuits}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Use Estimator to run three experiments in a single job, leveraging parameter values to increase circuit reusability.\n"
msgstr "Gunakan Estimator untuk menjalankan tiga eksperimen dalam satu kerja, dengan memanfaatkan nilai parameter bagi meningkatkan kebolehgunaan semula Circuit.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Use batches and advanced options {#use-batches-and-advanced-options}"
msgstr "Guna batch dan pilihan lanjutan {#use-batches-and-advanced-options}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Explore the batch [execution mode](/guides/execution-modes) and advanced options to optimize circuit performance on QPUs.\n"
msgstr "Terokai [mod pelaksanaan](/guides/execution-modes) batch dan pilihan lanjutan untuk mengoptimumkan prestasi Circuit pada QPU.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Next steps {#next-steps}"
msgstr "Langkah seterusnya {#next-steps}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Admonition type=\"tip\" title=\"Recommendations\">\n"
"- [Specify advanced runtime options](runtime-options-overview).\n"
"- Practice with primitives by working through the [Cost function lesson](/learning/courses/variational-algorithm-design/cost-functions) in IBM Quantum&reg; Learning.\n"
"- Learn how to transpile locally in the [Transpile](/guides/transpile/) section.\n"
"- Try the [Compare transpiler settings](/guides/circuit-transpilation-settings) guide.\n"
"- Understand the [Job limits](/guides/job-limits) when sending a job to an IBM&reg; QPU.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"<Admonition type=\"tip\" title=\"Cadangan\">\n"
"- [Tentukan pilihan runtime lanjutan](runtime-options-overview).\n"
"- Berlatih dengan primitif melalui [pelajaran Fungsi kos](/learning/courses/variational-algorithm-design/cost-functions) dalam IBM Quantum&reg; Learning.\n"
"- Pelajari cara untuk mentranspil secara tempatan dalam bahagian [Transpile](/guides/transpile/).\n"
"- Cuba panduan [Bandingkan tetapan transpiler](/guides/circuit-transpilation-settings).\n"
"- Fahami [Had kerja](/guides/job-limits) apabila menghantar kerja ke QPU IBM&reg;.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
